OL,3,GNEWSADead fish found at lake linked to
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of dead fish that have washed up
OL,7,Fon the shores of a west London lake are
OL,8,Fbelieved to have died due to a mass
OL,9,Falgal bloom caused by recent heatwaves.
OL,11,FResidents spotted the fish carcasses
OL,12,Fwhen walking through the Ruislip Lido
OL,13,Farea on Monday.
OL,15,FThe Environment Agency (EA) said
OL,16,Fofficers tested the water and believe a
OL,17,Frecent algal bloom, likely to have been
OL,18,Ftriggered by the prolonged heat this
OL,19,Fsummer, has caused a drop in oxygen in
OL,20,Fthe water.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
