OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADead fish found at lake linked to
OL,4,Aheatwave
OL,5,
OL,6,FHillingdon Council Conservative
OL,7,Fcouncillor Philip Corthorne said the
OL,8,Flake was now closed to fishing to
OL,9,Fpreserve stocks while work is
OL,10,Fundertaken to aerate it. He said it may
OL,11,Ftake three to four days to "stabilise
OL,12,Fthe lake" and the EA will reassess.
